<title>CHINA: Assets of foreign banks in Dalian $2.4 bln end-Mar.</title>
<headline>Assets of foreign banks in Dalian $2.4 bln end-Mar.</headline>
<dateline>BEIJING 1997-05-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>The assets of foreign-funded banks in China's northeastern port city of Dalian totalled $2.4 billion by the end of March, the official Xinhua news agency said on Friday.</p>
<p>The deposits of foreign-funded banks in Dalian stood at $257 million by end-March, Xinhua said without giving comparative figures.</p>
<p>A total of 27 foreign banks and insurance companies have opened branches in Dalian, the news agency said but gave no further details.</p>
<p>-- Beijing Newsroom (8610) 6532-1921</p>
</text>
